================================================================================
DATA ATTRIBUTION (retained from upstream)
================================================================================

Nutrition database: Open Food Facts (ODbL 1.0) — derivative databases must
share under the same terms. Brand names used nominatively.

Virtual routes: procedurally generated (Apache-2.0). Real-world routes:
geographic names are public facts; gradient profiles reference real elevation
data with OSM/DEM attribution where provenance allows (ODbL 1.0).

Workouts: interval structures based on public-domain exercise-physiology
patterns; names/descriptions original (Apache-2.0). Durability sessions (v1.4.0)
based on Muriel 2022 / Spragg 2023, original implementation.

Privacy: user data and connection tokens live under ~/.cpsl/. No training data
leaves the local machine except to intervals.icu / the user-configured LLM
provider when explicitly authorized.

